<b>Packers vs. Lions at 12:30 PM ET</b> and <b>Broncos vs. Cowboys at
4:05 PM ET</b>. Fantasy 2001 players, if you have players from
these four teams on your roster, they must have their final
status (active or reserve) set <b>5 minutes before the start of
their game</b>. Please keep in mind that you also will not be
able to enter any new add/drops for the week starting one
hour prior to Thursday's first kickoff. Football Commissioner players, check with your league's commissioner to see how your lineup deadline is handled this week.
</font></p></td> 
