mb!
ers. </FONT></FONT><BR><BR><A HREF="http://football222.fantasy.sportsline.com/mp/elink?script=players&league=bige01&owner=78977.7&random=2762&key=133448&"><B>Ricky Williams</B></A>, RB NO - Bass/Hull <FONT SIZE=1>Updated 11/16/01</FONT><BR><FONT FACE="Arial, Helvetica"><FONT SIZE=2>Williams is one of the better Fantasy backs in the league, and is a good player to use on a weekly basis. He'll face an Indianapolis defense that has been underachieving all season long, so Williams is a must-start.   </FONT></FONT><BR><BR><A HREF="http://football222.fantasy.sportsline.com/mp/elink?script=players&league=bige01&owner=78977.7&random=2762&key=133233&"><B>Aaron Brooks</B></A>, QB NO - Matty <FONT SIZE=1>Updated 11/16/01</FONT><BR><FONT FACE="Arial, Helvetica"><FONT SIZE=2>
