Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-From: Jennifer_Lamprecht@oxy.com
X-To: Susan.Hadix@elpaso.com, Tiffany_Lauer@manulife.com, tkuyken@enron.com
X-cc: 
X-bcc: 
