 -----Original Message-----
From:  "Onukogu, Ernest" <Ernest.Onukogu@dowjones.com>@ENRON 
[mailto:IMCEANOTES-+22Onukogu+2C+20Ernest+22+20+3CErnest+2EOnukogu+40dowjones+
