Karen,
     I have reviewed the redline document that Debra Perlingiere spent time
on.  It is not a finished product and needs a great deal of work.  I will
continue to work on it.  Apparently the redlining must have been confusing
and I need to start fresh.  I will try to get the redline to you as soon as
possible.  If we need to put something in place before the contract is
executed, maybe we can document the transaction under the existing GISB
contract currently in place between the parties and agree that the
transaction will be rolled up under the new master once the Master is
executed.



