Sounds very good and I agree with the suggestions to include the two listed
items from the Houston conference.  Here's one more suggestion:

Based on recent discussions (including at Strategic Planning last week), we
might consider adding as a topic European regulatory status, including the
Market Abuse Directive.  By December there should be a draft.  Annalisa
Barbargallo in our London office would be one good speaker.

We certainly hope Mark H will be able to attend and speak on California - as
Committee Chair and Board Member from Enron.

