Attached, please find the first of two set of materials for the meeting of
the Strategic Documentation Review Task Force on July 17, 2001.  As
indicated in the email sent to you on July 5, the meeting in London will be
held at ISDA's offices at One New Change from 2:00 to 5:00 and the meeting
in New York will be held at 125 Broad Street from 9:00 to 12:00.  The
meeting will begin with short presentations on the attached documents.

The materials attached in this email are:

1.	Annexes 1-7 amending various provisions of the 1992 ISDA Master
Agreement;
2.	Annex 8 amending Sections 6(d)(i) and (e) of the 1992 ISDA Master
Agreement;
3.	A User's Guide to the Amendments to the 1992 ISDA Master Agreement -
Annexes 1-8;
4.	2001 ISDA Master Agreement Protocol - Illegality and Force Majeure;
5.	Practice Notes to the 2001 ISDA Master Agreement Protocol -
Illegality and Force Majeure; and
6.	Chart on Illegality and Force Majeure.

If you have any questions, please contact me at 212-332-1203.

Kimberly Summe
Assistant General Counsel






