with and into El Paso Merchant Energy, L.P., CP ID 53350.  I have received 
copies of the Secretary of State certificate as well as the Certificate of 
Merger.  Today, I suspended the old record, so that new business will not 
attach to it.  Normally, notification would have been sent out on the 15th of 
the month, but since I have received phone calls, e-mails expressing 
concern,  and  copies of the documents from various groups (I appreciate 
it!), we thought it best to send notification now.  It will also appear on 
the next report.

