firm to "topock" , curious, is this somehow FERC related? Does this confirm
EPNG oversold Topock? ;Schematic at Topock ,tolerable ;Schematic at Hector ,
unacceptable, Mojave from South Needles should be 350 mmcfd  We should
probably discuss our CSA response. Give me a call , Mark , IGS


